  "ingredients": [
    "1 large russet potato, cut into evenly sized strips",
    "2 cups vegetable oil for frying, or as needed",
    "salt to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Soak potato strips in a large bowl of water for about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8JqeeJgcUgoM2ZN_NP7F4eBKc5Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219634-chef-johns-french-fries-ddmfs-30-step1-4x3-1b53b6e0572740cda5d64397848d6095.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219634/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pat with paper towels until thoroughly dry.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8FEswd6SzWc-LEr6LgGEn1J_3VY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219634-chef-johns-french-fries-ddmfs-31-step2-4x3-f3aa64c4f3d7485b8ecb710b54961846.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219634/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a deep-fryer or large saucepan to 275 degrees F (135 degrees C). Gently add potatoes to the hot oil and fry for about 5 minutes, stirring and flipping the potatoes occasionally.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oCP_PK_NWTx5M8e4F36C_Tuugn4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219634_Chef-Johns-French-Fries_DDMFS_Step3_1280-4x3-ae5518358a434f0fad629f886dd517bf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219634/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a slotted spoon to transfer potatoes to a paper towel-lined plate. Let cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/q7DqbHTZpFdsmQ_HJ0f38yDzag8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219634_Chef-Johns-French-Fries_DDMFS_Step4_1283-4x3-74ca49a35a994646ae24ffd91b1565a9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219634/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil again, but this time to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Add potatoes and fry a second time until golden brown, 5 to 6 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FXy99R4iBSPaXKL4C42XSN18JqA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219634_Chef-Johns-French-Fries_DDMFS_Step5_1287-4x3-238b8abfdf16422487dfe857651324fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219634/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the deep-fryer and blot with a paper towel. Sprinkle with salt to serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/r9yhtnbCclpQfyjGcTyZRHfTYfM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219634_Chef-Johns-French-Fries_DDMFS_Step6_1300-4x3-286394d64dc142e5a4baa2fc147fa1bb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219634/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JZsbJ8XNPxkbDk_hwHz-KI7nSKk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219634-chef-johns-french-fries-DDMFS-4x3-338dec7976fc4d75bb3e2c18ff6a6e95.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219634/step_07.webp"
    }
